    type "method"
    comment "&#10;     * Return if the caller requires the original file contents when calling&#10;     * {@link ContentResolver#openFileDescriptor(Uri, String)}.&#10;     *&#10;     * @see MediaStore#setRequireOriginal(Uri)&#10;     "
