    comment "&#10;     * Sets the data source (MediaDataSource) to use.&#10;     *&#10;     * @param dataSource the MediaDataSource for the media you want to extract from&#10;     *&#10;     * @throws IllegalArgumentException if dataSource is invalid.&#10;     "
  ]
