    label "public long getMostSignificantBits()"
    type "method"
    comment "&#10;     * Returns the most significant 64 bits of this UUID's 128 bit value.&#10;     *&#10;     * @return  The most significant 64 bits of this UUID's 128 bit value&#10;     "
