    comment "&#10;     * Gets the parent.&#10;     *&#10;     * @return The parent.&#10;     *&#10;     * @throws IllegalStateException If called outside of an {@link AccessibilityService} and before&#10;     *                               calling {@link #setQueryFromAppProcessEnabled}.&#10;     "
