    type "method"
    comment "&#10;     * The degrees that the view is rotated around the pivot point.&#10;     *&#10;     * @see #setRotation(float)&#10;     * @see #getPivotX()&#10;     * @see #getPivotY()&#10;     *&#10;     * @return The degrees of rotation.&#10;     "
